# What Expo's build servers receive when the mobile app in wedding-app/ is built.
# Expo uploads from the top of the repository, so without this file it takes
# everything here: the website, and any photos or other folders sitting beside it.
# Rule: nothing but wedding-app, and inside it no installed packages or local secrets.
/*
!/wedding-app
node_modules
.expo
dist
web-build
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.p8
*.jks
.claude
